{
  "_about": "The ONE list of credits. The Cloud Credits game (09) shows it and docs/CREDITS.md is generated from it (npm run credits). npm test fails if a file under public/sounds/ has no entry here (assets = paths or * globs relative to public/). Public repo: the parent approved their first name (Cami) in the credits; the child is credited by role only, never by name. Family names are typed on the device in Cloud Credits' 🔧 panel (entries with a 'family' key show them). 'author' = the person or handle exactly as shown on the source page. 'highlight' marks a key moment: the v1.1 scroll shows it as a big cloud card (true = the section title + its names; or { lines: [...] }).",
